                                },
                                "_lineno": 734,
                                "_col_offset": 0
                              },
                              {
                                "_type": "Constant",
                                "_fields": {
                                  "value": "\n\n---\nTHE MISSION:\nYou will draft a peer-to-peer message for the target defined in `mission_input_LIC.json`.\n\nCRITICAL REQUIREMENTS:\n- The message MUST align my specific capabilities with their stated strategic priorities.\n- The message MUST be between ",
